+  // Slow-path SSE head is committed HERE, before the upstream handler resolves, so the
+  // source `response` is NOT in scope yet — reading response.headers threw ReferenceError
+  // (→ 500 on every slow streaming request, e.g. tool-call turns). Build fresh transport
